# Purrfect Recall conventions

- Backend: FastAPI + SQLAlchemy + SQLite. Dev: `make start-api` or `make dev-api`
- Primary UI: native macOS/iOS apps (`apps/`). Legacy web: `frontend/index.html` via `make dev-web`
- After app/API changes: `make rebuild` (rebuild + relaunch PurrfectRecallMac + API)
- Layering: `app/routes/` → `app/schemas/` → `app/models/` → `study.db`
- Spaced repetition: FSRS in `app/services/fsrs_scheduler.py`
- No backend auth yet; do not assume `/auth` exists
- Prefer minimal diffs; match existing patterns (no framework without request)
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `README.md` before structural changes
